<translate>
==== CantBeConsolided ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
If this parameter is true, then this item (Drainable) cannot be combined with an item of a similar type.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
CantBeConsolided = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

